{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An exhilarating idle loot-based 3D infinite flow game where you adventure with beautiful waifus !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Idle Looting &amp; Casual Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can freely traverse worlds built from infinite flow worlds\u2014novel realms, movie settings, game universes, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in manual combat or choose idle battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In idle mode, simply sit back and wait to obtain high-tier gear and rare materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through levels, collect equipment, pets, and skills scattered across different worlds, and strengthen your character through upgrades\u2014pushing forward until the end of all realms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/\u8dd1\u56fe.gif?t=1753413223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/3\u670825\u65e5__2_.gif?t=1753413223\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Maidens' Realm &amp; Bonding System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter numerous magical maidens with distinct personalities in the vast multiverse\u2014these companions will always assist you in auto-battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a wealth of outfits and skins for free, shareable among all your magical maidens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase their affection levels, deepen your bonds, and interact with them intimately touch interactions !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/\u6362\u88c5.gif?t=1753413223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><d