alms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/\u8dd1\u56fe.gif?t=1753413223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/3\u670825\u65e5__2_.gif?t=1753413223\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Maidens' Realm &amp; Bonding System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter numerous magical maidens with distinct personalities in the vast multiverse\u2014these companions will always assist you in auto-battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a wealth of outfits and skins for free, shareable among all your magical maidens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase their affection levels, deepen your bonds, and interact with them intimately touch interactions !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/\u6362\u88c5.gif?t=1753413223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/extras/unknown_2025.03.24-16.06.gif?t=1753413223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Flower Dance"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205960/9d50584739e3a1aacb588afb1d5d683fe911bc7f/header.jpg?t=1753413223","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257051729,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.ak